"""
Workflow Service for Shizuha Pulse.

Handles workflow validation, transition logic, and post-function execution.
Supports both legacy (JSON-based) and scheme-based (model-based) workflows.

Features:
- Workflow Schemes: map item_types to different workflows per project
- Global Statuses: shared across workflows, with categories (todo/in_progress/done)
- Resolution Types: Fixed, Won't Fix, Duplicate, etc.
- Conditions: role-based, assignee-only, reporter-only, JSON Logic
- Validators: field_required, subtasks_done, regex_match, permission_check
- Post-Functions: set_field, assign_to, set_resolution, clear_resolution,
                  send_notification, fire_webhook, add_comment, update_parent
- Transition Screens: popup forms with required fields during transition
"""

